WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
A close view through the shooter shows purple artifacts in the spindexer. The ring advances beneath a small flap.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:18.000
The ring moves the artifacts past the flap. The camera pulls back to show their position below the flywheel and hood.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:25.600
The camera widens to the robot and pans across the practice field.
